1
00:00:22,799 --> 00:00:26,683
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

2
00:00:29,083 --> 00:00:33,698
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

3
00:00:35,571 --> 00:00:40,709
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

4
00:00:42,047 --> 00:00:47,056
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

5
00:00:48,267 --> 00:00:51,188
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

6
00:00:51,399 --> 00:00:54,490
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

7
00:00:54,787 --> 00:00:59,022
♪I sigh by the lamp over the long night♪

8
00:01:01,007 --> 00:01:03,915
♪Past memories unfold scene by scene♪

9
00:01:04,213 --> 00:01:07,099
♪It's all your face♪

10
00:01:07,409 --> 00:01:12,191
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

11
00:01:12,191 --> 00:01:16,771
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

12
00:01:16,771 --> 00:01:18,770
♪And another for youth passed♪

13
00:01:18,973 --> 00:01:24,755
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

14
00:01:25,139 --> 00:01:29,450
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

15
00:01:29,450 --> 00:01:31,958
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

16
00:01:32,204 --> 00:01:42,421
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

17
00:01:45,871 --> 00:01:48,705
=Prelude of the White Snake=

18
00:01:48,705 --> 00:01:51,623
=Episode 14=

19
00:01:53,959 --> 00:01:55,239
Let's go check it out there.

20
00:01:55,480 --> 00:01:56,719
There are some human hunters.

21
00:01:56,719 --> 00:01:57,760
- Yes.
- They're hunting now.

22
00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:59,799
- I can smell it from here.
- Come on, let's look.

23
00:01:59,799 --> 00:02:00,799
Human hunters?

24
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:19,360
Stop!

25
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:34,240
This aura feels like a high demon.

26
00:02:34,479 --> 00:02:35,479
Yes.

27
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:38,800
Let me handle this.

28
00:02:41,479 --> 00:02:43,319
This is my personal human pet.

29
00:02:44,759 --> 00:02:46,039
How dare you lay a hand on him?

30
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:52,240
What a pity. So this human
belongs to a high demon.

31
00:02:53,039 --> 00:02:54,039
We can't touch him.

32
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:55,439
Even if it's a high demon,

33
00:02:55,759 --> 00:02:57,800
keeping such a dangerous human
is still wrong.

34
00:02:58,400 --> 00:03:00,800
What if he escapes and hurts us one day?

35
00:03:02,759 --> 00:03:03,759
Useless trash!

36
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:06,639
You can't even handle
a few human hunters?

37
00:03:07,159 --> 00:03:09,000
You almost ruined my mood.

38
00:03:10,719 --> 00:03:11,719
Now get out of here.

39
00:03:24,796 --> 00:03:27,957
(Myriad Demons House)

40
00:03:32,879 --> 00:03:33,879
Master.

41
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:38,360
Have all the notices been posted?

42
00:03:38,479 --> 00:03:40,479
They've all been posted, Master.

43
00:03:40,479 --> 00:03:41,759
Someone even tore one down.

44
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:45,240
They've taken the bait.

45
00:04:03,319 --> 00:04:04,319
You're demons?

46
00:04:13,879 --> 00:04:15,360
Well, we have Leifeng Pagoda.

47
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:16,600
I let out some

48
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:18,360
of the demonic aura to cover us.

49
00:04:19,519 --> 00:04:20,519
That makes sense, right?

50
00:04:24,839 --> 00:04:25,839
It does.

51
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:33,519
The mural holds a world
where humans and demons are swapped.

52
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:35,920
Humans are evil, and demons are good.

53
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:39,319
This is absurd.

54
00:04:40,839 --> 00:04:43,199
Why do you think Changming
trapped us inside the mural?

55
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:45,759
Is it his lair or something?

56
00:04:46,639 --> 00:04:47,879
And he's taking us all down?

57
00:04:48,279 --> 00:04:49,279
Anyway,

58
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,680
saving Aunt comes first.

59
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:55,720
When I came in,

60
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:58,800
I saw this notice
at the Myriad Demons House's door.

61
00:04:58,800 --> 00:04:59,800
(Notice)

62
00:05:01,399 --> 00:05:02,680
I heard some lesser demons say

63
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:05,120
the master of the house
has taken a mortal

64
00:05:05,759 --> 00:05:06,759
who's deeply blessed.

65
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:09,120
He'll kill her on the right day

66
00:05:09,519 --> 00:05:10,519
as a tribute to heaven.

67
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:13,680
The master is Changming?

68
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:15,519
I don't care what "ming" he is.

69
00:05:15,519 --> 00:05:17,399
You know what?
I'm itching for a fight today.

70
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:18,800
I've been wanting to get him.

71
00:05:19,759 --> 00:05:21,319
But we know too little right now.

72
00:05:21,879 --> 00:05:22,879
I have an idea.

73
00:05:23,279 --> 00:05:25,600
Why don't we split up?

74
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,079
We can each gather intel

75
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:28,720
and decide later.

76
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:30,639
- I'll go with Suzhen.
- Sure. I'll go with Qing.

77
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:39,040
Maybe I should go
with Young Master Xu instead.

78
00:05:44,399 --> 00:05:46,399
Perfect. We'll go together.

79
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:51,680
Fahai,

80
00:05:54,319 --> 00:05:56,160
give me some of the demonic aura.

81
00:05:58,879 --> 00:06:01,160
Alright, sure.

82
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:02,600
Just hold onto this.

83
00:06:13,319 --> 00:06:14,319
Is it really that easy?

84
00:06:42,079 --> 00:06:44,279
My lord, everything is prepared.

85
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:46,040
Well done.

86
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:48,480
But I need to borrow your body.

87
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:52,839
Everything I have belongs to you.

88
00:06:53,279 --> 00:06:55,319
Please, my lord, use it as you wish.

89
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:31,600
I made some inquiries.

90
00:07:32,319 --> 00:07:34,160
The house's bottom two floors
are the dungeon.

91
00:07:34,879 --> 00:07:36,560
But I suspect this might be a trap

92
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:37,800
set by Changming.

93
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:39,160
So we'd better confirm

94
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:41,160
if Aunt is really being held there.

95
00:07:42,079 --> 00:07:43,439
I overheard the demons saying

96
00:07:43,639 --> 00:07:45,040
the master is selecting new women

97
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:46,480
to perform in the house tonight.

98
00:07:46,839 --> 00:07:48,680
Maybe I should sneak in with them.

99
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:49,680
No way.

100
00:07:51,319 --> 00:07:53,639
You have no spiritual power at all.

101
00:07:54,079 --> 00:07:55,319
You're only slightly stronger.

102
00:07:56,439 --> 00:07:57,920
You can't go. It's too dangerous.

103
00:08:00,199 --> 00:08:01,680
Thank you for the compliment.

104
00:08:04,879 --> 00:08:08,240
But for Aunt's sake, I have to go.

105
00:08:08,959 --> 00:08:11,199
Suzhen, it's not safe
for you to go alone.

106
00:08:11,199 --> 00:08:12,199
I'll sneak in with you.

107
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:15,680
Qing,

108
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:18,959
thank you for helping rescue my aunt.

109
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:23,199
Then we'll wait for you outside.

110
00:08:23,199 --> 00:08:26,360
Once you've confirmed,
signal us with the bells.

111
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:33,600
Keep yourself safe.

112
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:42,440
Suzhen, what's with you today?

113
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:45,279
You've been looking troubled.

114
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:48,320
I don't know why,

115
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:52,000
but I have a feeling that Changming
is targeting me this time.

116
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:53,960
That's impossible.

117
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:57,600
If that were true, why would he
take Xu Xian's aunt?

118
00:09:00,279 --> 00:09:01,279
It's just a gut feeling.

119
00:09:02,039 --> 00:09:03,279
You're overthinking it.

120
00:09:03,519 --> 00:09:05,200
You weren't the one who attacked him.

121
00:09:16,990 --> 00:09:19,255
(Myriad Demons House)

122
00:09:19,799 --> 00:09:20,799
Behave yourselves.

123
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:22,519
Now that you're in the house,

124
00:09:22,879 --> 00:09:24,360
wander off and you're dead.

125
00:09:24,559 --> 00:09:25,559
Take them away.

126
00:09:25,559 --> 00:09:26,559
Move!

127
00:09:32,360 --> 00:09:35,120
Changming would never
let us find Aunt so easily.

128
00:09:35,919 --> 00:09:37,519
Maybe because she's a human,

129
00:09:37,519 --> 00:09:39,159
she's being held in a special place.

130
00:09:57,399 --> 00:09:58,480
It's Aunt's earring.

131
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:23,480
Aunt?

132
00:10:24,519 --> 00:10:25,519
Aunt.

133
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:28,320
Are you alright?

134
00:10:30,679 --> 00:10:32,600
The door is made
of demon-suppressing stone.

135
00:10:32,919 --> 00:10:33,919
Don't act rashly.

136
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:37,559
Why did you come? Leave now.

137
00:10:37,639 --> 00:10:39,120
Aunt, just hold on a little longer.

138
00:10:39,559 --> 00:10:40,720
I'll get Xu Xian in here.

139
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:42,120
You must be careful.

140
00:10:42,679 --> 00:10:44,120
Don't do anything reckless.

141
00:10:44,639 --> 00:10:45,639
I'm fine.

142
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:05,080
What's going on?

143
00:11:14,559 --> 00:11:15,559
There's the signal.

144
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:17,399
Aunt is indeed in there.

145
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:19,240
Let's go.

146
00:11:22,639 --> 00:11:24,200
The trap is set.

147
00:11:26,679 --> 00:11:30,159
Allow me to give you all
another grand gift.

148
00:11:31,360 --> 00:11:32,440
Enjoy it.

149
00:11:33,919 --> 00:11:36,519
Everyone, follow me!

150
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:38,759
- Yes, Master!
- Yes, Master!

151
00:11:41,519 --> 00:11:42,559
We can't open this door.

152
00:11:43,159 --> 00:11:44,159
Stand back.

153
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:51,960
- Are you alright, Aunt?
- I'm fine.

154
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:52,960
We're getting you out.

155
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:54,440
Let's go.

156
00:11:55,519 --> 00:11:59,320
Why would they lock her in a cage
made of demon-suppressing stone?

157
00:12:00,159 --> 00:12:01,879
Probably to keep
the demons outside away.

158
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:04,679
Aunt, are you injured anywhere?

159
00:12:04,960 --> 00:12:05,960
I'm fine.

160
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:07,080
Are any of you hurt?

161
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:09,559
Stop chatting already.
We need to move now.

162
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:12,120
They'll find the dungeon
broken into soon.

163
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:14,759
We have to leave before they come.

164
00:12:14,759 --> 00:12:15,759
Hurry.

165
00:12:29,320 --> 00:12:30,320
Seize them.

166
00:12:32,159 --> 00:12:34,440
Suzhen, Qing, protect Aunt.

167
00:12:34,960 --> 00:12:35,960
Fahai and I will clear a path.

168
00:12:36,080 --> 00:12:38,639
Hold on. You stay here
and protect Suzhen and Aunt.

169
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:40,519
With his so-so skills,

170
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:41,720
I'd better do it.

171
00:13:11,744 --> 00:13:15,903
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

172
00:13:18,370 --> 00:13:22,748
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

173
00:13:24,291 --> 00:13:30,116
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

174
00:13:30,885 --> 00:13:35,352
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

175
00:13:38,217 --> 00:13:42,658
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

176
00:13:44,854 --> 00:13:49,584
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

177
00:13:50,796 --> 00:13:56,909
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

178
00:13:57,572 --> 00:14:03,354
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

179
00:14:03,354 --> 00:14:09,617
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

180
00:14:09,927 --> 00:14:16,286
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

181
00:14:16,457 --> 00:14:23,824
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

182
00:14:24,109 --> 00:14:29,656
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

183
00:14:30,147 --> 00:14:36,357
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

184
00:14:36,667 --> 00:14:43,440
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

185
00:14:44,437 --> 00:14:50,090
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

186
00:14:50,924 --> 00:14:55,332
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

187
00:14:56,097 --> 00:14:58,685
♪Having ever loved♪
